A linguist has expressed interest in using Lojban in linguistics research,
specifically in the area of semantics.  I don't have time to write up the
details for the List in general - maybe in a week or two when I know more.
However, I am interested in finding out who if any among the readership are
professional linguists who would be potentially interested in something of
this nature, either to participate in planning and/or conducting such
research, or in advising/consulting with those who are doing so.  I know
a few of you, and have contacted you directly, but I want to make sure that
I don't miss anyone that I've forgotten or don't know well.

I'm copying this to conlang in case there is someone there to whom this
query applies as well.

